,"explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"source_reading_cases":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line027-pei01-01:reading-000-261","kind":"annotation_sentence","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line027-pei01-01","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":261,"source_quote":"《江表傳》曰：初權在武昌，欲還都建業，而慮水道溯流二千里，一旦有警，不相赴及，以此懷疑。及至夏口，於塢中大會百官議之，詔曰：「諸將吏勿拘位任，其有計者，為國言之。」諸將或陳宜立柵柵夏口，或言宜重設鐵鎖者，權皆以為非計。時梁為小將，未有知名，乃越席而進曰：「臣聞香餌引泉魚，重幣購勇士，今宜明樹賞罰之信，遣將入沔，與敵爭利，形勢既成，彼不敢干也。使武昌有精兵萬人，付智略者任將，常使嚴整。一旦有警，應聲相赴。作甘水城，輕艦數千，諸所宜用，皆使備具。如此開門延敵，敵自不來矣。」權以梁計為最得，即超增梁位。後稍以功進至沔中督。","person_id":"dad_v9x_up1","related_person_ids":["572_278_cba"],"reading":"江表傳載小將張梁議夏口，為之升位，後至沔中督。","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-051-huan"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line027:m0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"張梁","kind":"person","person_id":"dad_v9x_up1","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line027","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line027:m0117","start":117,"end":119,"surface":"張梁","kind":"person","person_id":"dad_v9x_up1","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line027","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line027:m0202","start":202,"end":204,"surface":"張梁","kind":"person","person_id":"dad_v9x_up1","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line027","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-05